QuestGuidance.Register("en",277,{
[8833]="70058C7E\n1\tClaim the first encampment for Erebor\tThe enemy controls this location. You should claim this area for Erebor.\n2\tClaim the second encampment for Erebor\tThe enemy controls this location. You should claim this area for Erebor.\n3\tClaim the third encampment for Erebor\tThe enemy controls this location. You should claim this area for Erebor.\n4\tClaim the final encampment for Erebor\tThe enemy controls this location. You should claim this area for Erebor.\n",
[8834]="70057F09\n1\tPlant banners as you reclaim Bizar-atrâd (total: 4)\tReclaim Bizar-atrâd.\n",
[8835]="70057F4C\n1\tComplete Mission: Reclaiming the Vale-watch\tYour mission is to reclaim Bizar-atrâd. Speak to Hórin to travel to Bizar-atrâd.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8836]="7006C132\n1\tComplete Mission: Recovering the Past\tYour mission is to travel to Dûl Zidur and secure precious historical artifacts and scrolls before the Barkhûshim can destroy them. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu in Urmâkh\tYou have recovered the artifacts! Return with the scout to Udlanu in Urmâkh with this report.\n",
[8837]="7005BDED\n1\tDefeat frost grims (total: 6)\030Repair forges (total: 8)\030Defeat cold-drakes (total: 6)\tYou should repair the forges while fending off frost grims and cold-drakes\n2\tReturn to the forge entrance\tReturn to the forge entrance.\n",
[8838]="7005BDEE\n1\tComplete Mission: Reforging the Future\tYour mission is to repair several forges and secure the area. Speak to Hórin to travel to the forge.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8839]="700582E0\n1\tCollect dwarf-caches in Kidzul-kâlah (total: 12)\tYou have been tasked with recovering dwarf-caches from Kidzul-kâlah before the Dourhands can lay claim to them.\n",
[8840]="700582E5\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Relics of the Goldencleft'\tYour mission is to recover dwarf-caches from Kidzul-kâlah before the Dourhands can lay claim to them. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Kidzul-kâlah.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[8841]="7006D1C9\n1\tComplete Mission: Rescue at Gha Nêkha\tYour mission is to help the people of Gha Nêkha by forcibly removing the Ordâkhai soldiers there. Talk to Khâdamul when you are ready to travel to Gha Nêkha.\n2\tSpeak with Khâdamul in Iridír\tYou have saved the people of Gha Nêkha! Return with the Dumûri scout to report your success.\n",
[8842]="7006E4D3\n1\tComplete Mission: Rescue by Moonlight\tYou have been asked to rescue Avorthal, Elf-prince of Celondim, from the clutches of the Dourhands. While in the port-city of Kheledûl, you should also recover boxes of treasure stolen from the Longbeards by the Dourhands.\n2\tTalk to the Hooded Stranger in The Prancing Pony\tYou have successfully rescued Avorthal and recovered the boxes of treasure stolen from the Longbeards by the Dourhands.\n",
[8843]="7005984C\n1\tHelp dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ overcome thoughts of despair (total: 8)\tYour mission is to raise the spirits of disheartened soldiers of the Gabil'akkâ at Zarkul-sulûn and help them to overcome thoughts of despair.\n",
[8844]="7005984D\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Respite in Zarkul-sulûn'\tYour mission is to raise the spirits of disheartened soldiers of the Gabil'akkâ at Zarkul-sulûn and help them to overcome thoughts of despair. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath and travel to Zarkul-sulûn.\n2\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath at Akrâz-zahar.\n",
[8845]="7005A824\n1\tDestroy ritual obelisks (total: 6)\030Defeat fell spirits (total: 12)\tYou should disrupt the Angmarim ritual at Dûn Traikh.\n2\tRegroup near the north gate of Dûn Traikh\tYou should regroup near the north gate of Dûn Traikh.\n",
[8846]="7005A832\n1\tComplete Mission: Ritual of Sacrifice\tYour mission is to destroy the Angmarim ritual at Dûn Traikh. Speak to Ausma to travel to Dûn Traikh.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8847]="70072E9F\n1\tComplete Mission: Robbers on the Road\tYour mission is to go eastward on the road to Zajâna and see to the safety of a trade caravan travelling that road. Talk to Têsegi when you are ready to travel.\n2\tTalk to Têsegi Jiret-menêsh\tYou have completed your mission of ensuring the safety of the caravan. Return with the Temámir scout to report your success.\n",
[8848]="70072F85\n1\tComplete Mission: Routing Reinforcements\tYour mission is to enter into the guard barracks, destroy any of the barricades found within, and defeat their captain.\n2\tSpeak with Shâpar in Ahaba\tYou have secured the needed weapons for our resistance.\n",
[8849]="70070CD5\n1\tComplete Mission: Sampling the Bog-lurkers\tYour mission is to travel to Lhámuth and gather Pale Blight samples from the bog-lurkers there for the scholars of Sul Madásh. Speak to Várudar to travel.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYou have successfully gathered Pale Blight samples from the bog-lurkers in Lhámuth. Bring them to the scholars of Sul Madásh for them to study.\n",
[8850]="7005871A\n1\tRecover dwarf-remains from Scatha's Larder (total: 6)\tYour mission is to recover the scavenged remains of dwarves that met their ends in Scatha's Larder.\n",
[8851]="7005871D\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Scatha's Legacy'\tYour mission is to recover the scavenged remains of dwarves that met their ends in Scatha's Larder. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Scatha's Larder.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[8852]="7006C508\n1\tComplete Mission: Scavengers of Our Fallen\tYour mission is to travel to Khazâda and thin the numbers of jackals in the area as well as burn the corpses of slain travellers that have been defiled by the beasts. Speak with Raphûz to travel.\n2\tTalk to Raphûz\tYou have successfully slain jackals and burned the remains in Khazâda! Return with the scout to Raphûz with this report.\n",
[8853]="70062FBB\n1\tCollect plans (total: 3)\030Defeat brigands at the encampment (total: 12)\t\n2\tFind and speak with the scout\t\n",
[8854]="7006302C\n1\tComplete the Mission: Secrets and Plans\tMen from the south are a great threat to the populace and specifically to Mossward. You are asked to enter their encampment and seek any secret plans they may have.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tYou collected the plans and handed them to the scout who arrived to lead you away from the camp. You should return to the mission giver in Mossward to tell them what you learned.\n",
[8855]="70057EB1\n1\tComplete Mission: Secrets of the Frostdelf\tYour mission is to mine the Frostdelf. Speak to Hórin to travel to the Frostdelf.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8856]="70057EBE\n1\tMine the Frostdelf (total: 12)\tMine the Frostdelf.\n2\tInvestigate the noise coming from the Depths of Akhatâr\tInvestigate the noise coming from the Depths of Akhatâr.\n",
[8857]="7006C12F\n1\tComplete Mission: Securing Kûr Anzar\tThe Barkhûshim are attacking Kûr Anzar! Your mission is to destroy their makeshift fortifications and repel them from the lower ward of Kûr Anzar. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu in Urmâkh\tYou have successfully repelled the assault by the vile Barkhûshim! Return with the scout to Udlanu in Urmâkh with this report.\n",
[8858]="7006A327\n1\tComplete Mission: Securing Salvage\tA ship carrying weapons and supplies has been destroyed on the rocks in the Shield Isles and the cargo is washing ashore. Collect the salvageable supplies to keep them out of the hands of the Heirs of Castamir. Speak to Malthak to travel.\n2\tTalk to Malthak\tYou have collected the salvageable supplies and dealt with the Heirs of Castamir. Return to Malthak in the Bloody Eagle Tavern to report your success.\n",
[8859]="7005984F\n1\tSecure the first encampment on the Redhorn Pass\tYour mission is to secure the Redhorn Pass.\n2\tSecure the second encampment on the Redhorn Pass\tYour mission is to secure the Redhorn Pass.\n3\tSecure the third encampment on the Redhorn Pass\tYour mission is to secure the Redhorn Pass.\n4\tSecure the final encampment on the Redhorn Pass\tYour mission is to secure the Redhorn Pass.\n",
[8860]="70059857\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Securing the Redhorn'\tYour mission is to secure the Redhorn Pass. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath and travel to the Dimrill Dale.\n2\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath at Akrâz-zahar.\n",
[8861]="7005A81C\n1\tComplete Mission: Servants of Throkhâr\tYour mission is to defeat the Servants of Throkhâr and destroy their nameless shrines deep within Gundabad. Speak to Hórin to travel.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8862]="7005A82B\n1\tDestroy nameless shrines (total: 10)\030Defeat Servants of Throkhâr (total: 10)\tYou should defeat Servants of Throkhâr and destroy their nameless shrines.\n2\tDefeat Uknad, She Who Feeds\tYou should defeat Uknad, She Who Feeds.\n",
[8863]="70062D4F\n1\tComplete the Mission: Shadows in the Greyflood\tSpeak with the mission giver and let them know that you are ready to investigate the ruins along the banks of the Greyflood.\n2\tReturn to Hithriel and tell him of your findings\tWith your mission in the ruins successful, you should return to the mission giver and tell them of your findings.\n",
[8864]="70062D51\n1\tInvestigate along the banks of the Greyflood\tInvestigate the apparitions along the bank of the Greyflood.\n2\tApproach the scout to return to camp\tApproach the scout to return to camp.\n",
